{"seq":2,"slug":"ffi-and-c-interop","title":"FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/ffi-and-c-interop","wordCount":605,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ffi-与-c-互操作工程实践\">FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践</h1><p>Rust 的 FFI（Foreign Function Interface）是系统编程中连接 Rust 与现有 C/C++ 生态的桥梁。Linux 内核模块通过 bindgen 自动生成 C 绑定，嵌入式项目通过 FFI 调用芯片厂商的闭源 SDK，网络库通过包装 liburing 或 libc 访问操作系统服务。掌握 FFI 的安全工程模式——从 bindgen 自动化到手写安全封装——是将 Rust 引入任何已有系统代码库的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust FFI 建立在 C ABI 之上。<code>extern &quot;C&quot;</code> 函数遵循 C 的调用约定，<code>#[repr(C)]</code> 结构体遵循 C 的布局规则。FFI 的安全边界在于：Rust 编译器无法验证外部函数的行为，所有 FFI 调用都是 unsafe 的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Rust 侧&#10;        A[安全公开 API] --&gt; B[unsafe FFI 封装层]&#10;        B --&gt; C[bindgen 生成的 raw bindings]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph C 侧&#10;        D[C 头文件 .h] --&gt;|bindgen| C&#10;        E[C 库 .a/.so] --&gt;|链接| F[最终二进制]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    G[build.rs] --&gt;|编译 C 代码| E&#10;    G --&gt;|调用 bindgen| C\">graph LR\n    subgraph Rust 侧\n        A[安全公开 API] --&gt; B[unsafe FFI 封装层]\n        B --&gt; C[bindgen 生成的 raw bindings]\n    end\n    subgraph C 侧\n        D[C 头文件 .h] --&gt;|bindgen| C\n        E[C 库 .a/.so] --&gt;|链接| F[最终二进制]\n    end\n    B --&gt; E\n    G[build.rs] --&gt;|编译 C 代码| E\n    G --&gt;|调用 bindgen| C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>FFI 方向</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rust 调用 C</td>\n<td><code>extern &quot;C&quot; { fn ... }</code></td>\n<td>bindgen</td>\n<td>使用 C 库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 调用 Rust</td>\n<td><code>#[no_mangle] pub extern &quot;C&quot; fn</code></td>\n<td>cbindgen</td>\n<td>Rust 库给 C 用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C++ 调用 Rust</td>\n<td>cxx bridge</td>\n<td>cxx crate</td>\n<td>安全 C++ 互操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust 调用 C++</td>\n<td>cxx bridge</td>\n<td>autocxx</td>\n<td>包装 C++ 类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bindgen-自动生成绑定\">bindgen 自动生成绑定</h2><p>bindgen 解析 C 头文件并生成对应的 Rust FFI 声明。在 <code>build.rs</code> 中配置 bindgen 是 Rust FFI 项目的标准做法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// build.rs&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rerun-if-changed=wrapper.h&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rustc-link-lib=uring&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let bindings = bindgen::Builder::default()&#10;        .header(&quot;wrapper.h&quot;)&#10;        .allowlist_function(&quot;io_uring_.*&quot;)&#10;        .allowlist_type(&quot;io_uring.*&quot;)&#10;        .allowlist_var(&quot;IORING_.*&quot;)&#10;        // 生成 Debug/Clone derive&#10;        .derive_debug(true)&#10;        .derive_default(true)&#10;        // 将 C 的 enum 映射为 Rust 的 newtype 常量&#10;        .default_enum_style(bindgen::EnumVariation::NewType {&#10;            is_bitfield: false,&#10;            is_global: false,&#10;        })&#10;        // 阻止生成 layout tests（加快编译）&#10;        .layout_tests(false)&#10;        .generate()&#10;        .expect(&quot;bindgen 生成失败&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let out_path = std::path::PathBuf::from(std::env::var(&quot;OUT_DIR&quot;).unwrap());&#10;    bindings.write_to_file(out_path.join(&quot;bindings.rs&quot;)).unwrap();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rerun-if-changed=wrapper.h\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rustc-link-lib=uring\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let bindings = bindgen::Builder::default()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .header(\"wrapper.h\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .allowlist_function(\"io_uring_.*\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .allowlist_type(\"io_uring.*\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .allowlist_var(\"IORING_.*\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 生成 Debug/Clone derive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .derive_debug(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .derive_default(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 将 C 的 enum 映射为 Rust 的 newtype 常量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .default_enum_style(bindgen::EnumVariation::NewType {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is_bitfield: false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is_global: false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 阻止生成 layout tests（加快编译）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .layout_tests(false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .generate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .expect(\"bindgen 生成失败\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let out_path = std::path::PathBuf::from(std::env::var(\"OUT_DIR\").unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bindings.write_to_file(out_path.join(\"bindings.rs\")).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// src/lib.rs — 引入生成的绑定&#10;#![allow(non_upper_case_globals)]&#10;#![allow(non_camel_case_types)]&#10;&#10;mod ffi {&#10;    include!(concat!(env!(&quot;OUT_DIR&quot;), &quot;/bindings.rs&quot;));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// src/lib.rs — 引入生成的绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#![allow(non_upper_case_globals)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#![allow(non_camel_case_types)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod ffi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    include!(concat!(env!(\"OUT_DIR\"), \"/bindings.rs\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"安全封装层设计\">安全封装层设计</h2><p>raw bindings 不应直接暴露给用户。安全封装层的职责是：验证所有前置条件、管理资源生命周期（RAII）、将 C 错误码转为 Rust Result。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::io;&#10;use std::os::fd::{AsRawFd, OwnedFd, FromRawFd};&#10;&#10;pub struct IoUring {&#10;    ring: ffi::io_uring,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl IoUring {&#10;    pub fn new(entries: u32) -&gt; io::Result&lt;Self&gt; {&#10;        let mut ring = unsafe { std::mem::zeroed() };&#10;        let ret = unsafe { ffi::io_uring_queue_init(entries, &amp;mut ring, 0) };&#10;        if ret &lt; 0 {&#10;            return Err(io::Error::from_raw_os_error(-ret));&#10;        }&#10;        Ok(Self { ring })&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn submit(&amp;mut self) -&gt; io::Result&lt;usize&gt; {&#10;        let ret = unsafe { ffi::io_uring_submit(&amp;mut self.ring) };&#10;        if ret &lt; 0 {&#10;            return Err(io::Error::from_raw_os_error(-ret));&#10;        }&#10;        Ok(ret as usize)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    /// 获取一个 SQE 用于提交操作&#10;    /// 返回 None 表示 SQ 已满&#10;    pub fn get_sqe(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Option&lt;SqeRef&lt;&#39;_&gt;&gt; {&#10;        let sqe = unsafe { ffi::io_uring_get_sqe(&amp;mut self.ring) };&#10;        if sqe.is_null() {&#10;            None&#10;        } else {&#10;            Some(SqeRef { sqe, _ring: self })&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Drop for IoUring {&#10;    fn drop(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        unsafe { ffi::io_uring_queue_exit(&amp;mut self.ring); }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/// SQE 的生命周期绑定到 IoUring——防止 submit 后访问&#10;pub struct SqeRef&lt;&#39;a&gt; {&#10;    sqe: *mut ffi::io_uring_sqe,&#10;    _ring: &amp;&#39;a IoUring,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::os::fd::{AsRawFd, OwnedFd, FromRawFd};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct IoUring {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ring: ffi::io_uring,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl IoUring {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(entries: u32) -> io::Result&#x3C;Self> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut ring = unsafe { std::mem::zeroed() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let ret = unsafe { ffi::io_uring_queue_init(entries, &#x26;mut ring, 0) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if ret &#x3C; 0 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Err(io::Error::from_raw_os_error(-ret));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(Self { ring })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn submit(&#x26;mut self) -> io::Result&#x3C;usize> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let ret = unsafe { ffi::io_uring_submit(&#x26;mut self.ring) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if ret &#x3C; 0 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Err(io::Error::from_raw_os_error(-ret));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(ret as usize)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 获取一个 SQE 用于提交操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 返回 None 表示 SQ 已满</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn get_sqe(&#x26;mut self) -> Option&#x3C;SqeRef&#x3C;'_>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let sqe = unsafe { ffi::io_uring_get_sqe(&#x26;mut self.ring) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if sqe.is_null() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Some(SqeRef { sqe, _ring: self })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Drop for IoUring {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn drop(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { ffi::io_uring_queue_exit(&#x26;mut self.ring); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/// SQE 的生命周期绑定到 IoUring——防止 submit 后访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct SqeRef&#x3C;'a> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sqe: *mut ffi::io_uring_sqe,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _ring: &#x26;'a IoUring,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"字符串与切片的跨界传递\">字符串与切片的跨界传递</h2><p>C 字符串（以 null 结尾）和 Rust 字符串（长度标记 + UTF-8）的转换是 FFI 中最易出错的环节。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::ffi::{CStr, CString};&#10;use std::os::raw::c_char;&#10;&#10;// Rust → C: 必须确保 null 终止&#10;pub fn open_file(path: &amp;str) -&gt; io::Result&lt;OwnedFd&gt; {&#10;    let c_path = CString::new(path)&#10;        .map_err(|_| io::Error::new(io::ErrorKind::InvalidInput, &quot;路径含 null 字节&quot;))?;&#10;&#10;    let fd = unsafe { libc::open(c_path.as_ptr(), libc::O_RDONLY) };&#10;    if fd &lt; 0 {&#10;        return Err(io::Error::last_os_error());&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(unsafe { OwnedFd::from_raw_fd(fd) })&#10;}&#10;&#10;// C → Rust: 必须验证 UTF-8 有效性&#10;pub unsafe fn log_message(msg: *const c_char) {&#10;    if msg.is_null() { return; }&#10;    let c_str = unsafe { CStr::from_ptr(msg) };&#10;    match c_str.to_str() {&#10;        Ok(s) =&gt; println!(&quot;[C] {}&quot;, s),&#10;        Err(_) =&gt; println!(&quot;[C] (非 UTF-8 数据)&quot;),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::ffi::{CStr, CString};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::os::raw::c_char;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust → C: 必须确保 null 终止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn open_file(path: &#x26;str) -> io::Result&#x3C;OwnedFd> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let c_path = CString::new(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|_| io::Error::new(io::ErrorKind::InvalidInput, \"路径含 null 字节\"))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let fd = unsafe { libc::open(c_path.as_ptr(), libc::O_RDONLY) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if fd &#x3C; 0 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(io::Error::last_os_error());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(unsafe { OwnedFd::from_raw_fd(fd) })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// C → Rust: 必须验证 UTF-8 有效性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub unsafe fn log_message(msg: *const c_char) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if msg.is_null() { return; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let c_str = unsafe { CStr::from_ptr(msg) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match c_str.to_str() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(s) => println!(\"[C] {}\", s),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(_) => println!(\"[C] (非 UTF-8 数据)\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"回调函数与闭包传递\">回调函数与闭包传递</h2><p>C 库经常使用函数指针回调。将 Rust 闭包传给 C 回调需要通过 trampoline 模式——一个 <code>extern &quot;C&quot;</code> 的自由函数加一个 <code>*mut c_void</code> 用户数据指针。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// C 侧 API 期望：&#10;// void register_callback(void (*cb)(int event, void* userdata), void* userdata);&#10;&#10;type CCallback = extern &quot;C&quot; fn(event: i32, userdata: *mut std::ffi::c_void);&#10;&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;    fn register_callback(cb: CCallback, userdata: *mut std::ffi::c_void);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Rust 侧封装&#10;pub struct EventHandler&lt;F: FnMut(i32)&gt; {&#10;    closure: F,&#10;}&#10;&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; fn trampoline&lt;F: FnMut(i32)&gt;(event: i32, userdata: *mut std::ffi::c_void) {&#10;    let handler = unsafe { &amp;mut *(userdata as *mut EventHandler&lt;F&gt;) };&#10;    (handler.closure)(event);&#10;}&#10;&#10;pub fn register&lt;F: FnMut(i32)&gt;(mut handler: EventHandler&lt;F&gt;) {&#10;    let ptr = &amp;mut handler as *mut EventHandler&lt;F&gt; as *mut std::ffi::c_void;&#10;    unsafe {&#10;        register_callback(trampoline::&lt;F&gt;, ptr);&#10;    }&#10;    std::mem::forget(handler); // 防止 handler 被 Drop&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// C 侧 API 期望：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// void register_callback(void (*cb)(int event, void* userdata), void* userdata);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type CCallback = extern \"C\" fn(event: i32, userdata: *mut std::ffi::c_void);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn register_callback(cb: CCallback, userdata: *mut std::ffi::c_void);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust 侧封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct EventHandler&#x3C;F: FnMut(i32)> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    closure: F,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" fn trampoline&#x3C;F: FnMut(i32)>(event: i32, userdata: *mut std::ffi::c_void) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handler = unsafe { &#x26;mut *(userdata as *mut EventHandler&#x3C;F>) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (handler.closure)(event);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn register&#x3C;F: FnMut(i32)>(mut handler: EventHandler&#x3C;F>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let ptr = &#x26;mut handler as *mut EventHandler&#x3C;F> as *mut std::ffi::c_void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        register_callback(trampoline::&#x3C;F>, ptr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::mem::forget(handler); // 防止 handler 被 Drop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cbindgen-生成-c-头文件\">cbindgen: 生成 C 头文件</h2><p>当 Rust 库需要被 C 代码调用时，cbindgen 从 Rust 源码生成对应的 C/C++ 头文件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Rust 库的公开 API&#10;#[no_mangle]&#10;pub extern &quot;C&quot; fn rust_compress(&#10;    input: *const u8,&#10;    input_len: usize,&#10;    output: *mut u8,&#10;    output_cap: usize,&#10;) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    if input.is_null() || output.is_null() {&#10;        return -1;&#10;    }&#10;    let input_slice = unsafe { std::slice::from_raw_parts(input, input_len) };&#10;    let output_slice = unsafe { std::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(output, output_cap) };&#10;&#10;    match compress_impl(input_slice, output_slice) {&#10;        Ok(written) =&gt; written as i32,&#10;        Err(_) =&gt; -1,&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust 库的公开 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[no_mangle]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub extern \"C\" fn rust_compress(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input: *const u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input_len: usize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    output: *mut u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    output_cap: usize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if input.is_null() || output.is_null() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let input_slice = unsafe { std::slice::from_raw_parts(input, input_len) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let output_slice = unsafe { std::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(output, output_cap) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match compress_impl(input_slice, output_slice) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(written) => written as i32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(_) => -1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>cbindgen 生成的头文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"/* auto-generated by cbindgen */&#10;int32_t rust_compress(const uint8_t *input, uintptr_t input_len,&#10;                      uint8_t *output, uintptr_t output_cap);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* auto-generated by cbindgen */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int32_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rust_compress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uintptr_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> input_len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uintptr_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> output_cap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>bindgen 自动生成 C→Rust 绑定，cbindgen 生成 Rust→C 头文件</li>\n<li>安全封装层验证前置条件 + RAII 管理资源 + 错误码转 Result</li>\n<li>CString/CStr 处理 null 终止字符串，跨界传切片需固定长度参数</li>\n<li>闭包通过 trampoline + userdata 指针模式传给 C 回调</li>\n<li>所有 FFI 调用是 unsafe，安全验证责任在封装层</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"performance-profiling\">性能分析与调优</a> 覆盖如何量化验证 FFI 封装的开销</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/unsafe-and-ffi\">Rust 语言 - unsafe 与 FFI</a> 覆盖 extern 和 ABI 的语法基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践","id":"ffi-与-c-互操作工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"bindgen 自动生成绑定","id":"bindgen-自动生成绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"安全封装层设计","id":"安全封装层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"字符串与切片的跨界传递","id":"字符串与切片的跨界传递"},{"level":2,"text":"回调函数与闭包传递","id":"回调函数与闭包传递"},{"level":2,"text":"cbindgen: 生成 C 头文件","id":"cbindgen-生成-c-头文件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"无锁数据结构实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/lock-free-data-structures"},"next":{"title":"系统级性能分析与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/performance-profiling"}}